    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061122.0106\n\nBUCHAREST, Nov. 22 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nUrgent: A MiG-21 crashes in Romania\n\n\n\n\nA MiG-21 fighter jet crashed in western Romania's Arad county on Wednesday.\n\nThe accident occurred at about 13:00 local time (GMT 11:00), according to a local Reality TV report. More",
